<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9485" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">commūtābĭlis</span></b> ,
			e, adj.
		commuto, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>subject to change</i>, <i>changeable</i> (class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					N. D. 3, 12, 30</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">haec imbecilla et commutabilis pecunia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Par. 1, 1, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">commutabilis, varius, multiplex animus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Lael. 25, 92</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ratio vitae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Mil. 26, 69</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">principia verbi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 9</span></i>
			. § 99 Müll.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In rhet.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exordium quod ab adversario potest, leviter
					mutatum, ex contrariā parte dici, = commune,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Inv. 1, 18, 26</span></i>
			; so * <i><span class="en">Quint. 4, 1, 71</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
